      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_25d366ddf5f194aa907f",
      "document_start": 106,
      "document_end": 163,
      "text": "研究刚体在惯性空间中的一般运动时，可以用其质心坐标系确定位置，用质心坐标系相对于地面坐标系的方向余弦矩阵确定方位。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_f8e6c4b5d78a976582f4",
      "document_start": 163,
      "document_end": 194,
      "text": "为了解析描述的方位，必须规定一组转动广义坐标表示方向余弦矩阵。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8437eeae6d63c9920875",
      "document_start": 194,
      "document_end": 284,
      "text": "通常用刚体的质心笛卡儿坐标和反映刚体方位的欧拉角作为广义坐标，由于采用了不独立的广义坐标，系统动力学方程虽然数量最多，但是高度稀疏耦合的微分代数方程，适用于稀疏矩阵方法的高效求解。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ed8d217d0a5b5650390a",
      "document_start": 286,
      "document_end": 306,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 2;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_73e0351cc2f8df672b56",
      "document_start": 307,
      "document_end": 319,
      "text": "# 2.笛卡儿广义坐标;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_5a65678a61cb363b2a28",
      "document_start": 320,
      "document_end": 352,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_45a83db7ffe7f31a5dc5",
      "document_start": 354,
      "document_end": 431,
      "text": "刚体连体基在某个时刻的姿态可以认为是一个刚体的连体基起始方向与惯性基平行，绕自身的坐标轴按照右手定则3—1—3顺序连续3次转动（如图2-13所示）的结果。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_2edd8ec3d77c3b630513",
      "document_start": 433,
      "document_end": 453,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 3;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8784af4e2fb6aef65953",
      "document_start": 454,
      "document_end": 458,
      "text": "# 3.",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6c48beb7cc17652295db",
      "document_start": 459,
      "document_end": 466,
      "text": "系统约束方程;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_b05c7585592a7c070a93",
      "document_start": 467,
      "document_end": 499,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a64dc2965af2df65142f",
      "document_start": 501,
      "document_end": 536,
      "text": "由于系统中一些刚体间存在铰（运动副），所以铰限制了刚体之间的相对运动。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8999dcaf118d5b6ef8c9",
      "document_start": 536,
      "document_end": 575,
      "text": "一般情况下，描述系统位形的笛卡儿坐标并不完全独立，在运动过程中，它们存在某些关",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0c8ce2feaa89e6139b6b",
      "document_start": 577,
      "document_end": 597,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 4;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9f17f4c5f36e671ad2ca",
      "document_start": 598,
      "document_end": 602,
      "text": "# 3.",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_d4cf88ac3a0f8e1aff1e",
      "document_start": 603,
      "document_end": 610,
      "text": "系统约束方程;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8f11e9c70e7a12d65e5b",
      "document_start": 611,
      "document_end": 643,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_0e90a2a82defabd4664e",
      "document_start": 645,
      "document_end": 664,
      "text": "系，这些关系的解析表达式就是约束方程。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ae066456bfb49ad7d836",
      "document_start": 664,
      "document_end": 686,
      "text": "约束方程的建立通常有局部方法和总体方法两种。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_094beb45d69d3b7ed106",
      "document_start": 686,
      "document_end": 716,
      "text": "局部方法统一由铰的偶对刚体出发，对同一类铰，约束方程有共性。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_4ec281133264378f6628",
      "document_start": 716,
      "document_end": 734,
      "text": "系统的约束方程是各铰约束方程的组集。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_21df37cb27e94a612b5f",
      "document_start": 734,
      "document_end": 768,
      "text": "而总体方法缺乏这种共性，方程的建立更多地依赖于用户的经验和分析能力。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_de0500ecaf8912c27e6d",
      "document_start": 768,
      "document_end": 820,
      "text": "局部方法得到的约束方程个数虽然可能远大于总体方法，但它是一种程式化的方法，在计算多体动力学中被普遍使用。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_37a8611cf53e7ea074ae",
      "document_start": 820,
      "document_end": 850,
      "text": "系统受到的约束包括所有铰链的运动约束和驱动器产生的驱动约束。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_8f7fe8a282f64107797e",
      "document_start": 852,
      "document_end": 872,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 5;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_6d91d2ff7f9f92e389e2",
      "document_start": 873,
      "document_end": 882,
      "text": "# 1）运动约束;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_3eb1e3c96d62a102a9ba",
      "document_start": 883,
      "document_end": 915,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_85089439e27b8e106c81",
      "document_start": 917,
      "document_end": 972,
      "text": "不同的铰链对它所连接的两个邻接刚体产生不同的约束，但是所有这些不同的约束方程都是由几个基本代数关系作为基础的。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_de604beccab2fdc1d8d4",
      "document_start": 972,
      "document_end": 1053,
      "text": "在力学研究中有4种最基本的约束：垂直(Perpendicular）约束、共点（Atpoint)/球铰约束、点面（Inplane）约束和角度（Angular）约束。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a774a7617c90946f4496",
      "document_start": 1053,
      "document_end": 1075,
      "text": "其他所有约束都可以从这4种最基本的约束导出。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_ed82bf6d5c4e5c472d75",
      "document_start": 1075,
      "document_end": 1090,
      "text": "这里仅介绍垂直约束和共点约束。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_9c23a1e573886e0d5062",
      "document_start": 1092,
      "document_end": 1112,
      "text": "[Source paragraph 6;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a20190a4a21df1ef6237",
      "document_start": 1113,
      "document_end": 1124,
      "text": "# 3）初始条件分析;",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_091fad5f91149254e518",
      "document_start": 1125,
      "document_end": 1157,
      "text": "intervening text may be omitted]",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": "sentence_a0c09d353a6654dd3896",
      "document_start": 1159,
      "document_end": 1256,
      "text": "在进行动力学、静力学分析之前，为了让初始系统模型中各物体的坐标与各运动学约束之间达成协调，保证满足系统所有的约束条件，需要进行初始条件分析，通过求解相应的位置、速度、加速度目标函数的最小值得到。",
      "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9"
    }
