        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_0e90a2a82defabd4664e",
          "document_start": 645,
          "document_end": 664,
          "text": "系，这些关系的解析表达式就是约束方程。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 645,
          "end": 664,
          "chunk_start": 645,
          "chunk_end": 664,
          "sentence_document_start": 645,
          "sentence_document_end": 664,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_ae066456bfb49ad7d836",
          "document_start": 664,
          "document_end": 686,
          "text": "约束方程的建立通常有局部方法和总体方法两种。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 664,
          "end": 686,
          "chunk_start": 664,
          "chunk_end": 686,
          "sentence_document_start": 664,
          "sentence_document_end": 686,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_094beb45d69d3b7ed106",
          "document_start": 686,
          "document_end": 716,
          "text": "局部方法统一由铰的偶对刚体出发，对同一类铰，约束方程有共性。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 686,
          "end": 716,
          "chunk_start": 686,
          "chunk_end": 716,
          "sentence_document_start": 686,
          "sentence_document_end": 716,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_4ec281133264378f6628",
          "document_start": 716,
          "document_end": 734,
          "text": "系统的约束方程是各铰约束方程的组集。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 716,
          "end": 734,
          "chunk_start": 716,
          "chunk_end": 734,
          "sentence_document_start": 716,
          "sentence_document_end": 734,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_21df37cb27e94a612b5f",
          "document_start": 734,
          "document_end": 768,
          "text": "而总体方法缺乏这种共性，方程的建立更多地依赖于用户的经验和分析能力。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 734,
          "end": 768,
          "chunk_start": 734,
          "chunk_end": 768,
          "sentence_document_start": 734,
          "sentence_document_end": 768,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_de0500ecaf8912c27e6d",
          "document_start": 768,
          "document_end": 820,
          "text": "局部方法得到的约束方程个数虽然可能远大于总体方法，但它是一种程式化的方法，在计算多体动力学中被普遍使用。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 768,
          "end": 820,
          "chunk_start": 768,
          "chunk_end": 820,
          "sentence_document_start": 768,
          "sentence_document_end": 820,
          "sentence_complete": true
        },
        {
          "sentence_id": "sentence_37a8611cf53e7ea074ae",
          "document_start": 820,
          "document_end": 850,
          "text": "系统受到的约束包括所有铰链的运动约束和驱动器产生的驱动约束。",
          "section_id": "section_ea5825ca19f9",
          "start": 820,
          "end": 850,
          "chunk_start": 820,
          "chunk_end": 850,
          "sentence_document_start": 820,
